  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Beside crescent lake, Chai Zhang’s face flushes as he calls Zhong Tribe shameless for holding five black skin fat beetles on the road to the heroes assembly. Chai tribe is a small scale tribe; Zhong tribe had expanded into a mid-scale tribe two years earlier. Three of the beetles hold goods Chai tribe gathered to side with Liu Wen Wu.",
      "chapters": [
        494
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beetles-on-the-road",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crescent_lake",
        "char_chai_zhang",
        "fac_zhong_tribe",
        "char_liu_wen_wu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan’s wolf army arrives under the Chang Shan Yin name, Chai Zhang and Zhong Fei You shift from near fighting to a shared urge to cooperate under the encirclement.",
      "chapters": [
        494
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wolf-king-at-the-lake",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_chang_shan_yin",
        "char_zhong_fei_you"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From a distance Chai Zhang refuses elders who hope to reclaim leftovers, says staying risks Chang Shan Yin’s slaughter, and orders the tribe to leave at once. A tribe of that size is too weak to ride the Imperial Court fight alone and needs a stronger force to cling to.",
      "chapters": [
        495
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "leaving-crescent-lake",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_imperial_court"
      ]
    }
